# Allowlist for the API image (Dockerfile): the build context holds only what the builder stage
# copies. Everything else (.git, tests, workshop, app/frontend, .env, local builds) never reaches
# Docker at all. The frontend image has its own context and ignore file in app/frontend/.
*
!app/__init__.py
!app/__main__.py
!app/backend/
!scripts/obfuscate.py
!scripts/verify.py
!requirements.txt
**/__pycache__
